{
  "title": "ISic001367. Funerary inscription for Rhodine",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa, Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al0-interpretive\"><!--0--></a>𐆠 𐆠 𐆠 <br id=\"al1-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">Ἐνθάδε</span>  <span data-text=\"κῖτε\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"κεῖμαι\">κῖτε</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ῥοδίνη\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ῥοδίνη\"><span data-text=\"Ῥοδίνη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Ῥοδίνη\">Ῥοδίνη</span></span></span>  <span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ἔζησεν</span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ἔτη</span>  <span data-text=\"εἴκοσι\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"εἴκοσι\">εἴ[κ]οσι</span>  <span data-text=\"πέντε\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"πέντε\">πέν(τε)</span>  <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"τελευτάω\">ἐτελεύτησεν</span>  <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"δὲ\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"δέ\">δὲ</span>  <span data-text=\"τῇ\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">τῇ</span>  <span data-text=\"πρὸ\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"πρό\">πρὸ</span> · <span data-text=\"ι·α\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"εἷς\"><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ι</span>·<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">α</span></span>´ · <span data-text=\"εἰ\n                    δῶν\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"Idus\">εἰ-<br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>δῶν</span>  <span data-text=\"Νοβεμβρί\n                    ων\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"November\">Νοβεμβρί-<br id=\"al7-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>ων</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.4)</span> Α ☧ Ω </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Dmitry Dundua, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"Ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">Ἐνθάδε</span>  <span data-text=\"κῖτε\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"κεῖμαι\">κῖτε</span>  <span data-text=\"Ῥοδίνη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Ῥοδίνη\">Ῥοδίνη</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ἔζησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ἔτη</span>  <span data-text=\"εἴκοσι\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"εἴκοσι\">εἴκοσι</span>  <span data-text=\"πέντε\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"πέντε\">πέντε</span>  <span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"τελευτάω\">ἐτελεύτησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"δὲ\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"δέ\">δὲ</span>  <span data-text=\"τῇ\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">τῇ</span>  <span data-text=\"πρὸ\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"πρό\">πρὸ</span>  <span data-text=\"ια\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"εἷς\">ια</span>  <span data-text=\"εἰδῶν\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"Idus\">εἰδῶν</span>  <span data-text=\"Νοβεμβρίων\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"November\">Νοβεμβρίων</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.4)</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa, Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al0-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a>𐆠𐆠𐆠<br id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"κῖτε\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"κεῖμαι\">ΚΙΤΕ</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ῥοδίνη\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ῥοδίνη\"><span data-text=\"Ῥοδίνη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Ῥοδίνη\">ΡΟΔΙΝΗ</span></span></span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ΕΖΗΣΕΝ</span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ΕΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"εἴκοσι\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"εἴκοσι\">ΕΙ[.]ΟΣΙ</span><span data-text=\"πέντε\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"πέντε\">ΠΕΝ</span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"τελευτάω\">ΕΤΕΛΕΥΤΗΣΕΝ</span><br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"δὲ\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"δέ\">ΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"τῇ\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">ΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"πρὸ\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"πρό\">ΠΡΟ</span>·<span data-text=\"ι·α\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"εἷς\"><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">Ι</span>·<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">Α</span></span>·<span data-text=\"εἰ\n                    δῶν\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"Idus\">ΕΙ<br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>ΔΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"Νοβεμβρί\n                    ων\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"November\">ΝΟΒΕΜΒΡΙ<br id=\"al7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>ΩΝ</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Α☧Ω</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Dmitry Dundua, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"κῖτε\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"κεῖμαι\">ΚΙΤΕ</span><span data-text=\"Ῥοδίνη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Ῥοδίνη\">ΡΟΔΙΝΗ</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ΕΖΗΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ΕΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"εἴκοσι\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"εἴκοσι\">ΕΙΚΟΣΙ</span><span data-text=\"πέντε\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"πέντε\">ΠΕΝΤΕ</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"τελευτάω\">ΕΤΕΛΕΥΤΗΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"δὲ\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"δέ\">ΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"τῇ\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">ΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"πρὸ\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"πρό\">ΠΡΟ</span><span data-text=\"ια\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"εἷς\">ΙΑ</span><span data-text=\"εἰδῶν\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"Idus\">ΕΙΔΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"Νοβεμβρίων\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"November\">ΝΟΒΕΜΒΡΙΩΝ</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text of IGPalermo but corrected against photograph; note that Kaibel followed Alessi's apograph, which does not observe the original layout.</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"line 3\">line.3: <span>ἔτη εἴ[κ]οσι πέν(τε) IMusPalermo 8; ἔτη ε CIG IV 9484; ἔτη ε [μῆνας] IG IV 548</span>  </span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 5\">line.5: <span>Alessi: ΠΡΟΤΑ; Kirchoff: προτ[έρ]ᾳ; Manni Piraino: πρὸ ⟨ι⟩α’; the two numerals ι α are clearly distinguished by interpuncts and a line above, which joins the top of the iota (whence misinterpretation as Τ).</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>Here lies Rhodine. She lived for 25 years and died on the eleventh day before the Ides of November.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>This Christian inscription is marked by three Christograms at the beginning and one at the end. Kirchhoff’s and Kaibel’s transcription is inaccurate with regard to the division of the text into lines and was probably based on Alessi’s apographs. The reading of the sequence <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">πρὸ ∙ τ ∙ α</span> in l. 5 is explained by Manni Piraino (1973, 29–30) as a cutter’s error for <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">πρὸ ∙ ∙ α</span>. The interpretation as “the eleventh day before the Ides of November” is preferable to <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">πρὸ γ νωνῶν</span>, since, in this period, dating by the Ides is preferred to dating by the Nones (see IG XIV 524, likewise from Catania). The name of the deceased, <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Ῥοδίνη</span>, is otherwise unattested in Sicily, although it occurs in Latin inscriptions from Magna Graecia (CIL X 2155, X 2407, both from Puteoli).</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Alessi 1833 229 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002538\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002538</a>  </li><li> Alessi 1833 174 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002540\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002540</a>  </li><li> Kirchhoff 1877 9484 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249</a>  </li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">548</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a>  </li><li> Manni Piraino 1973 8 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Cursive A, Μ, Ω, lunate Σ, uncial A at l. 7.</p> Line 1  20-30  Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence </div>",
