μβρί-<br id=\"al7-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>ων</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.4)</span> Α ☧ Ω </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Dmitry Dundua, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"Ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">Ἐνθάδε</span>  <span data-text=\"κῖτε\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"κεῖμαι\">κῖτε</span>  <span data-text=\"Ῥοδίνη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Ῥοδίνη\">Ῥοδίνη</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ἔζησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ἔτη</span>  <span data-text=\"εἴκοσι\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"εἴκοσι\">εἴκοσι</span>  <span data-text=\"πέντε\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"πέντε\">πέντε</span>  <span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"τελευτάω\">ἐτελεύτησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"δὲ\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"δέ\">δὲ</span>  <span data-text=\"τῇ\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">τῇ</span>  <span data-text=\"πρὸ\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"πρό\">πρὸ</span>  <span data-text=\"ια\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"εἷς\">ια</span>  <span data-text=\"εἰδῶν\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"Idus\">εἰδῶν</span>  <span data-text=\"Νοβεμβρίων\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"November\">Νοβεμβρίων</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.4)</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa, Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al0-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a>𐆠𐆠𐆠<br id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"κῖτε\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"κεῖμαι\">ΚΙΤΕ</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</spa